5. Developer access
The discussion distinguished several separate access needs:

Azure resource visibility: Potentially read access to inspect resources.
Container Registry: Access appropriate to the developer’s image-related tasks.
AKS: Cluster authentication and the required namespace or pod permissions.
Terraform: Repository contribution, workspace access, and apply permissions are separate decisions.
Developers can potentially contribute through reviewed repository changes without automatically receiving Terraform workspace or apply access. Confirm the minimum permissions, network or jump-server requirements, approvals, and access process with the cloud team.

